%% Cart building with state verification
flowchart TD
    B[Basket items] --> L[For each item]
    L --> ADD["add_to_cart(sku, packs)"]
    ADD --> RE[Re-read cart]
    RE --> CK{sku present AND qty increased by packs?}
    CK -- no --> ERR[CartVerificationError]
    CK -- yes --> NX[Next item]
    NX --> VC["verify_cart(expected sku:qty)"]
    VC --> OK{All match, no extras?}
    OK -- no --> ERR
    OK -- yes --> DONE[Cart verified]
